OL,3,GNEWSAEU rules on Artificial
OL,4,AIntelligence devices will apply in NI
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome EU rules on Artificial
OL,7,FIntelligence (AI) will apply in
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland, the UK government has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FHowever the regulation of AI in NI will
OL,12,Flargely be a matter for the UK
OL,13,Fgovernment and Stormont.
OL,15,FEU rules will only apply to physical
OL,16,Fgoods which have an embedded AI system.
OL,18,FThey will apply due to the Windsor
OL,19,FFramework, the Brexit deal which keeps
OL,20,FNI inside the EU's single market for
OL,21,Fgoods.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
